  "/services/excel-consolidation": {"title":"Excel & CSV File Consolidation — Reviewable Merged Workbook | دمج ملفات إكسل","description":"Combine multiple authorized Excel or CSV files into a consistent master workbook with traceable source rows, duplicate flags, source reconciliation and a review queue. Get a fixed-scope quote after checking a redacted sample.","note":"The available example uses 3 fictional source workbooks and 12 rows with 3 flagged records. It is not a real customer's 87-file project or a published XLSX download on this page. Mapping different workbook formats, formulas and complex scans must be assessed before pricing.","extra":"<section style='padding:20px;background:#11182b;border:1px solid #354460;border-radius:14px;margin:25px 0'><h2>What is included in a scoped consolidation</h2><ul style='line-height:1.8'><li>Review source workbook and worksheet structure; agree which headers should map together</li><li>Preserve source file, sheet and source row in the consolidated output</li><li>Flag missing identifiers, candidate duplicates, formula conflicts and unmapped fields rather than guessing</li><li>Reconcile counts per source and provide a review queue for uncertain records</li><li>Deliver an editable master workbook with a short QA summary</li></ul><p>Inspect the <a style='color:#9fe6b8' href='/examples#consolidation'>fictional 3-workbook demonstration and validation results</a>. This is authentic sample work, not a client testimonial.</p><section lang='ar' dir='rtl' style='border-top:1px solid #354460;padding-top:14px'><h2>دمج ملفات Excel وCSV في ملف واحد</h2><p style='color:#b9c0d4'>نراجع الأعمدة والبيانات الموجودة في الملفات الأصلية، ونحتفظ بمصدر كل صف، ونكشف التكرار والنواقص دون حذف معلومات أو اختلاق بيانات. يمكنك طلب عرض سعر بعد تقديم وصف للملفات وعينة خالية من المعلومات الحساسة.</p></section></section>"},
  "/services/restaurant-stock-dashboard": {"title":"Restaurant Inventory & Supplier Dashboard — Excel Pilot","description":"An Excel stock and supplier dashboard tailored to your restaurant: purchase log, stock issues, on-hand quantity, reorder alerts, supplier balance and summary KPIs. First we agree units, volume and acceptance rules.","note":"Our existing spreadsheet is a formula-driven demonstration using only fictional data, not a previous paid restaurant deployment. We confirm scope, price and delivery after a redacted sample review.","extra":"<section aria-label='Scope and fictional sample' style='border:1px solid #354460;background:#11182b;border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin:25px 0'><h2>What the dashboard can cover</h2><ul style='line-height:1.8'><li>Purchases: supplier, item, date, quantity, unit and calculated amount</li><li>Stock issues: record kitchen usage and other outflows separately</li><li>On-hand inventory: opening plus purchases minus issues; flag reorder and negative balances</li><li>Supplier ledger: purchases, payments and outstanding due</li><li>Executive summary: stock value, purchase total and supplier due</li></ul><p><strong>Proof:</strong> a fictional-data Excel workbook with these sheets and formulas. Review the publicly documented formulas and fictional input: <a style='color:#9fe6b8' href='/examples#restaurant'>Restaurant stock demo and CSV sample →</a></p><h2>Request a scoped pilot</h2><p>Tell us approximately how many stock items and suppliers you manage, whether you track consumption, and the Excel version used. No production credentials or customer records are needed for initial discovery.</p><p><a style='color:#9fe6b8;font-weight:750' href='/automation#b2b-lead'>Request a free inventory dashboard scope review →</a></p><p style='font-size:13px;color:#b9c0d4'>Not a POS integration, verified accounting valuation, live deployment or automatic invoice generator. Unit conversions, ingredient recipes, stock expiry and multi-site transfers need separate scoping.</p></section>"},

